2.stable.mono - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT (RADV GFX1200) - AMD Ryzen 7 9700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 30.48 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the Inspector, the AtlasTextures's background checkerboard doesn't match the actual texture. For example, if the MRP the AtlasTextures's region is 16x16. The background checkerboard is also 16x16. But there seems to be somekind of size difference as the pixels (texture pixels and checkerboard pixels) do not match.\n\nThis is not a huge problem, but it made me check if there is some problem in the texture or if I entered a wrong texture size or something.\n\n<img width=\"757\" height=\"644\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6cae8df2-68ec-4f24-885d-190c60d45d27\" />\nzoomed:\n<img width=\"468\" height=\"412\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f2f9ff6a-3cb0-4918-a1da-4cfb8a0b51d4\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMake an AtlasTexture with a small region size, e.g. 16x16 pixels.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[texture-16.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26852372/texture-16.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_ur